## 🆘 Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

**"Please set your GROQ_API_KEY"**
- Make sure you've entered a valid Groq API key
- Check that the key has sufficient credits

**"Error calling Groq API"**
- Verify your internet connection
- Check if the Groq service is available
- Ensure your API key is valid and active

**Agents not responding correctly**
- Try with simpler code examples first
- Check if the input code is valid Python syntax
- Restart the application if needed

### Getting Help
- Check the [Groq Documentation](https://console.groq.com/docs)
- Review [CrewAI Documentation](https://docs.crewai.com/)
- Open an issue if you find bugs

---

**🎉 Happy Debugging!** This tool will help you identify and fix Python code errors quickly using the power of AI agents.